        <mxCell id="A9" value="A9  Evaluation and minimal diagnostics (cross-cutting)&#10;Test A2-A8: correctness, grounding, clarification, scope, clarity, privacy, latency, reliability.&#10;Record test IDs, scores, timings, versions and redacted errors; no persistent raw user chats.&#10;Inspect outgoing payloads with synthetic identifiers; retain only sanitised test evidence.&#10;Links: O3 | NFR1-NFR4 | RAI1-RAI4 | Part B evaluation criteria" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f0e8fa;strokeColor=#8c76a7;fontSize=25;align=left;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="950" width="1680" height="230" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot" value="Conceptual design only. Components express capabilities; vendors, frameworks and deployment remain undecided." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=21;fontColor=#183b50;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
